<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>Confirmed -  None   Week Ago - 1,000   Year Ago -   800</p>
<p>Wk to Date - None   Week Ago - 6,400   Year Ago - 3,900</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
